OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright and breezy start.
OL,6,FChilly in places too. A few showers
OL,7,Faround during the day, mainly in the
OL,8,Fnorth, otherwise plenty of fine
OL,9,Fweather with some sunny spells.
OL,10,FFeeling pleasantly warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine, and as winds ease.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMany eastern and southeastern
OL,14,Fareas will have a dry night with clear
OL,15,Fspells and gentle winds. Elsewhere
OL,16,Fbecoming cloudier and breezy, even
OL,17,Fwindy in the northwest, with some
OL,18,Fshowery rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
